    <iwda:evidenceType>same_sentence_cooccurrence</iwda:evidenceType>
    <iwda:evidenceSentence>For example, payment systems have long used machine learning automatically to block suspicious payments – and one card scheme is this year upgrading its fraud detection system using a foundation model trained on a purported one trillion data points.</iwda:evidenceSentence>
